### CREATE ENTRY
POST http://localhost:4000/api/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId" : "572",
  "multipleEntryId" : "1",
  "currency": "USD",
  "concept": "Concept 4",
  "date" : "2021-02-18T21:54:42.123Z",
  "creditBalance": 1000.00
}

### DESCRIBE ENTRY
GET http://localhost:4000/api/entries/9da17f6f-29ea-4dc6-ae35-3a54eced8021
Accept: application/json

### LIST ALL ENTRIES
GET http://localhost:4000/api/entries
Accept: */*
Cache-Control: no-cache

### LIST ALL ENTRIES WITH EXPAND FILTER
GET http://localhost:4000/api/entries?expand=true
Accept: */*
Cache-Control: no-cache

### UPDATE ENTRY
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/entries/9da17f6f-29ea-4dc6-ae35-3a54eced8021
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId" : "570",
  "multipleEntryId" : "1",
  "currency": "USD",
  "concept": "Concept 5",
  "date" : "2021-02-18T21:54:42.123Z",
  "debitBalance": 1000.00
}

### DELETE ENTRY
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/entries/9da17f6f-29ea-4dc6-ae35-3a54eced8021
Content-Type: application/json



